  "id": "treatment-effectiveness-evaluation",
  "term": "treatment effectiveness evaluation",
  "definition": "Treatment effectiveness evaluation is the assessment of how well a treatment works by measuring changes caused by the condition and its response over time. In this source, it refers to using quantifiable retinal structural changes together with functional testing to judge therapeutic benefit.",
